<title>POLAND: RAFAKO REVISES UP H1 NET.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO REVISES UP H1 NET.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rafako SA final results for the</p>
<p>first six months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						H1 96	  H1 95</p>
<p>    operating			     15.47   vs   17.29</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  8.16   vs   15.14</p>
<p>    net					8.16   vs    9.89</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Raciborskie Fabryki Kotlow</p>
<p>Rafako SA. Earlier the company has reported its net and pre-tax</p>
<p>profit at 2.5 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales			     196.61  vs   164.33</p>
<p>    costs of sales			164.68  vs   128.20</p>
<p>    extraordinary			   0.04  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				0.00  vs     5.25</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    3.85  vs     2.60</p>
<p>    financial costs			11.35  vs     4.75</p>
<p>    investment				2.78  vs    10.65</p>
<p>    depreciation			    4.53  vs     2.48</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
